    "description": "BAGHDAD: Iraq’s new prime minister Ali Al-Zaidi has said he is aiming to secure major US investment in his country’s oil, gas, and power sectors during a visit to the White House this week, after ​the Iran war hammered crude output and state finances. On a visit to the US, he met President Donald Trump in Washington on Tuesday, as the administration piles pressure on Baghdad",
